      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DESPICABLE KYRO (4) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and six placings from 14 starts. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (22.23) in a Grade 4/5 last time at this track. Looks a key chance on best form. MAGIC WYLDE (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.83) at this track behind Blazing Raso in a Mix 2/3. Has the pace to be prominent. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Leading player again. CALYPSO ETHICS (5) was below best last time when fourth at this track but prior to that among the placings in quick time (25.49) at this track. Safe beginner but tricky box to overcome. Can hit the frame this time. COOKIE MAN (2) placed two runs ago then again in the money last time when third (20.06) at Grafton in a NG. Good beginner aided by a handy draw.",
